WEBVTT

00:05:29.515 --> 00:05:31.396
I wanted to cry.

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:34.302
But I was too tired to cry.

00:05:34.728 --> 00:05:36.577
The adrenaline was gone.

00:05:36.601 --> 00:05:39.371
I had felt as if the inner scaffolding

00:05:39.395 --> 00:05:41.832
that had held me together
since my diagnosis

00:05:41.856 --> 00:05:43.497
had suddenly crumbled.

00:05:44.173 --> 00:05:51.082
I had spent the past 1,500 days
working tirelessly to achieve one goal:

00:05:51.106 --> 00:05:52.487
to survive.

00:05:52.511 --> 00:05:54.416
And now that I'd done so,

00:05:54.440 --> 00:06:00.071
I realized I had absolutely
no idea how to live.